Package: owncast
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Self-hosted live streaming server with chat (Owncast)
 Owncast is a self-hosted live streaming and chat server: push RTMP from
 OBS or any encoder to the TNAS and viewers watch in the browser with
 low-latency HLS playback, built-in chat, and a customizable front page.
 Watch at http://<NAS>:18239; push to rtmp://<NAS>:1935/<streamKey>
 (key generated at install, stored in /var/lib/owncast/config.yaml).
 Upstream project: https://github.com/owncast/owncast (MIT), packaged
 unmodified.
